      "spanKey": "page_57_unit_p57-block-80-body-size-10pt-paragraph-2__pt-BR",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "sourceText": "Some Combatants have multiple Monster Loot rewards. For example, the Cave Sickle has 3; Sickle Shell Charm, Sickle Venom, and Chipped Chitin. In these cases, shuffle them and Pull a card from the bottom. If an Adventurer cannot draw a Monster Loot Item Card for the opponent they Defeated, they shuffle the Monster Loot Card back into the Combatant Loot deck and redraw. If the Monster Loot Card is the only card left in the Combatant Loot deck, discard it instead.",
      "proposalText": "Alguns Combatentes têm várias recompensas de Saque de Monstro. A Cave Sickle, por exemplo, tem 3: Sickle Shell Charm, Sickle Venom e Chipped Chitin. Embaralhe essas cartas e retire uma do fundo do baralho. Se o Aventureiro não puder retirar uma Carta de Item de Saque de Monstro correspondente ao oponente Derrotado, recoloque a Carta de Saque de Monstro no Baralho de Saque de Combatentes, embaralhe e retire outra. Se essa for a única carta restante nesse baralho, descarte-a.",
